3. Navigation Commands

Show current directory
pwd

pwd = Print Working Directory

Example:
/home/manish
List files
ls

Detailed listing:
ls -l

Show hidden files:
ls -a

Detailed + hidden:
ls -la

Human-readable file sizes:
ls -lh

Change directory
cd directory

Example:
cd /home
Go to home directory:

cd ~
or simply:
cd

Go to parent directory:
cd ..

Go to previous directory:
cd -

Go to root directory:
cd /

