8. File Manipulation Commands

Create a file
touch file.txt

Copy
cp file.txt backup.txt

Move
mv file.txt /tmp/

Rename
mv old.txt new.txt

Delete
rm file.txt

Change permissions
chmod 644 file.txt

Change ownership
sudo chown user:user file.txt

Change group
sudo chgrp group file.txt

Create a symbolic link
