10. Useful Text Processing Commands

Count lines, words and characters
wc file.txt

Only lines:
wc -l file.txt

Only words:
wc -w file.txt

Only characters:
wc -c file.txt

Sort output
sort file.txt

Reverse order:
sort -r file.txt

Remove duplicate consecutive lines
uniq file.txt

Count duplicates:
uniq -c file.txt

Display selected columns
cut -d ":" -f 1 /etc/passwd

Search command history
history

Search history:
history | grep ssh
